  "releaseNotes": "fixed `JSImage.tryLoad` never resolving on load failure: the `<img>` error handler was registered as `oneror` (typo) instead of `onerror`, so 404s and decode errors hung forever\nfixed `WorkerContext.Terminate` throwing `JSException`: the host-side `window.workers.terminate` JS function it dispatches to was never defined; added it alongside the other `window.workers.*` shims\nadded in-browser test coverage for the JS interop and Web Worker APIs (DOM mutation, `JsObj.Evaluate`, `Window.Location`, `JSImage` round-trip, `Worker.start` / send / receive / echo / dispose)",
